    },
    {
        "model": "campaign_trail.answer_feedback",
        "pk": 21693,
        "fields": {
            "answer": 21681,
            "candidate": 201,
            "answer_feedback": "Brown holds firm, refusing to agree to step down until a coalition is finalised, he still thinks he’s in control and it shows, looks like Labour will be a no-go. Wasn’t 13 years enough?"
        }
    },
    {
        "model": "campaign_trail.answer_feedback",
        "pk": 21694,
        "fields": {
            "answer": 21682,
            "candidate": 201,
            "answer_feedback": "You and Danny meet with Cameron and Osborne, by the end of the meeting you seemed to have grabbed the Deputy spot, let’s just hope you’ll have the guts to make use of it."
        }
    },
    {
        "model": "campaign_trail.answer_feedback",
        "pk": 21699,
        "fields": {
            "answer": 21685,
            "candidate": 201,
            "answer_feedback": "“Flash Gordon” doesn’t have it in him anymore, and you can see it. That’s not how Labour receives it, partially insulated, Brown leaves the negotiations with a scowl on his face. Deep down, he knows what this means."
